cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this evidence release, please cite it as below."
title: "Gubernaut Cognitive Controller — Evidence & Verification Release (4x4 + frozen 3x3)"
authors:
  - name: "Gubernaut Research"
year: 2026
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered, cross-family, generate-once / judge-many evaluation of a
  deterministic runtime control layer for LLMs. Four frontier models
  (GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.8, Gemini 3.5 Flash, Grok 4.3), each both generator
  and judge, form a symmetric 4x4 matrix: regulated output beats baseline in
  15/16 cells (11/12 off-diagonal, 4/4 diagonal), with recovery replicating
  4/4. The earlier three-model 3x3 was pre-registered and frozen before the
  fourth family was added; adding it changed no earlier cell, and both ship
  verbatim. Transcripts, judge panels (sha256), and the combine script are
  published so the result is independently re-computable.
